# Centuria 1.7.4
Centuria 1.7.4 is a much overdue server and client patch thats the first step on the path of making the software more maintainable, this mostly implements overdue fixes and changes to the chat filters.

We know this update doesnt really provide much gameplay-wise, but its an important step to getting development back up, as with this patch done, the server's unfinished changes are out the door, and we can finally start working on creating updates again!


## Server changes

Dependency changes:
- Updated ConnectiveHTTP to Alpha 19

Major changes:
- Changed the default server ports! From now on, API is 37501, Director is 37502, Gameserver is 37503, Chatserver is 37504, and Voicechatserver is 37505
- Completely overhauled the item system to work with string def IDs instead of numeric def IDs only, do note that this is still limited and can be unstable
- Changed item transmission so that item operations only send changed items and not the full inventory, speeding up performance with unbinding and a lot more
- Backported the simplified 1.8 Event Bus
- Rewrote the automatic update system, see updater.json generated on server startup for customization of the server, it now has support for downloading additional resource like modules or assets and such

New features in the server:
- Added a new API Event: AccountDisplayNameChangedEvent
- Implemented proper support for trade chats, they will no longer overwrite DMs
- Added new command: gcrename/gcr: a command to rename group chats
- Added new command: gclistmembers/gclm: a command to list group chat members
- Added new command: gctransfer/gct: a command to transfer ownership of group chats
- Added new command: skipsanctuaryupgrade, a command to skip sanctuary upgrade timers
- Implemented the AFK kick, but dont worry, it is not as short as the og game's AFK kicker

Fixes to the server:
- Fixed server components such as chat in some cases sending over the wrong timestamp format causing the game to be unable to display correct times due to the game thinking the server sends over local time instead of UTC
- Fixed typo in the dm inactivity warning messages
- Fixed some parser issues with SaveSettings leading to improper loading of options where it caused the wrong field to be assigned, leading to some settings being unconfigurable
- Fixed enigmas not being obtainable through creative commands
- Fixed giveitem/takeitem commands not working when the player is offline
- Changed giveitem to be allowed by non-admin moderators
- Fixed updateshutdown command and server update disconnects using incorrect message strings
- Fixed removing items in trade not always going through to the other player
- Added a message notifying the player if a dm or group chat is deleted
- Heavily improved blocking functionality, DMs will no longer go through to deleted or blocked members, however the blocker can still send messages to the one they blocked, just not the other way around, typing statuses are properly filtered now too


Moderation-related changes:
- Implemented logging of account deletion, registration and display name changes, as well as unpairing and pairing of accounts
- Made it that some minor moderation events arent posted as a ping in the moderation log channel, so account operations wont ping but still will be logged
- Implemented "alert flagging" in the chat filters, we can now add specific words to the filters that alert staff without censoring, so that when certain topics are discussed ingame, we can be alerted by the server as it happens without censoring conversations, this also highlights flagged messages ingame
- Fixed some chat filter bugs that caused messages to be saved uncensored into message logs
- Improved the chat filter reason strings and added highlighting of censored content for moderators to allow staff to be able to see what was censored
- Implemented advanced rewritten text filters, capable of limited context-sensitive filtering
- Implemented heightened strictness mode, a text filter mode enabled when there are too many filter triggers, designed to help moderate with large activity when not enough team members are ingame, the filter will alert the staff when this mode activates and filter more aggressively until staff disables the mode
- Implemented the ability to let the server disable the chat if too many filter triggers happen until staff logs on
- Added a room identifier to server logs so staff can see which room (eg. map) a message is sent in, previously it just dumped all chats into one log with no way to see which world it was
- Implemented better anti-spam logic, acting more like a chat rate limit that alerts staff, instead of banning
- New mute syntax:
`>mute "<player>" ["<reason>"]` - permanent
`>mute "<player>" <minutes> ["<reason>"]` - for a few minutes
`>mute "<player>" <hour> <minutes> ["<reason>"]` - for hours and minutes
`>mute "<player>" <days> <hour> <minutes> ["<reason>"]` - for days, hours and minutes
- Added a permanent mute command
- Added a permanent mute command to the discord bot (mute without time parameters is treated as permanent)
- Fixed the discord bot mute command not processing the reason argument
- Added the ability to trade-ban players preventing them from trading, to both the server and discord bot


Changes to the repository:
- The server project now uses polytool, a work in progress tool for building the project

## Launcher changes

New features in the launcher:
- The launcher now supports relative urls (relative to the feraltweaks data downloader) for downloads of launcher and game assets, this is useful for self-hosting to allow the launcher to directly download from the self-hosted server without having to hardcode the urls all over the place
- The launcher now supports downloading platform-specific client mods and assets through `assets-osx`, `assets-win64` and `assemblies-osx`, `assemblies-win64` folders in feraltweaks clientmod downloads

New features in the installer:
- Added an installer overview page where the installation process can be configured
- Added a way, via the installer, to pick wine versions to use with the game, this can also be accessed post-installation by reopening the installer
- The installer now copies itself to the installation path, allowing it to be called to modify or uninstall the software from windows
- Added proper handling of cases where the launcher may be on a disconnected disk while running the installer, the installer would now notify with this being the case and properly deal with uninstalling while the disk is not connecte
- Added support for URL protocols on widnows and linux....unfortunately not doing this on mac yet as why did apple make it overcomplicated
- Added windows registry support to the installer, new installations as well as installations updated using the new installers will add the emulator to the program list in windows control panel / settings under applications, allowing the emulator to be removed via the regular windows settings menu

Fixes to the launcher:
- The launcher now uses http keepalive, this means it will be reusing connections, making downloads more stable and reliable, this will likely help with the unexpected disconnects

Fixes to the installer:
- Fixed the installer improperly causing "Could not connect with the launcher servers" errors while connected if the install folder is on a disk not connected at the time, __this also fixes any rare cases where the installer does not function while offline while having installed the game before__, meaning that you can use the uninstaller even if the game is offline

__**Note:** you will need to reinstall the game using the installers from our downloads channel for most of these features to work.__ (do keep in mind to also download the installers again)


## Changes to the client

Fixes to both clients:
- Implemented the ability to chat while in the customizer
- Fixed the chat windows not saving coordinates on logout
- Fixed custom decree entries not using ignoreYear properly, now entries can be made that are annual
- Fixed the extremely poor performance issues with display name loading, which caused immense lag loading the social list and dm chats, this also fixes the issue of extremely slow loading of chats on PC

